@startuml 05f-theory
title 图 05F · late-π 规范族 → 工程 API 映射
caption <color:#6E6963>15 规范族 / 60 registry codes；family 由 operationCode 派生，禁止 caller 双提交。</color>

map "P1c 规范族" as Families {
  freeOutput => send / asyncSend / quiescentSend
  boundOutput => boundOutput
  lateInput => receive / boundInput / syncReceive
  communication => comm / fork / join / par*
  openClose => scopeOpen
  restriction => scopeClose
  scopeExtrusion => scopeExtrusion / scopeIntrusion
  delegation => delegation / handoff
  dynamicPartnerAdmission => newChannel
  instanceReconnect => reconnect / reconnectHandoff
  instanceDeleteQuiescent => delete / quiescentDelete
  choiceLeft => choiceLeft / tauPrefix / eventLog
  choiceRight => choiceRight
  matchSuccess => matchEqTrue
  mismatchGuard => mismatch / mismatchGuard
}

note bottom of Families
  锚点：P1cMatrix.lean · Operations.lean · P1cOperationRegistry.lean
  comms 每次 occurrence 持久 registryVersion + operationCode + nativeAction
end note

@enduml
